  (text "Secure element: NXP SE051 on I2C0. ENA low is deep power-down; R5 holds it on. VOUT ties to VCC (SE_VCC), as the data sheet asks when ENA is used." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 191.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f5fc67a3-ca2b-4d2e-b514-f81fea0d8895"))
  (text "Antenna: C15 (27 pF) and C16 (not fitted, trim) across LA/LB at the chip, SW4 opens the LA line, ANT1 is the four-turn loop on the front." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0a8734d5-4e54-4a46-be7d-2e8a22eaf243"))
